# Kiro's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## The report: the plan's monthly credits, bonus credits, and overages, as
## the Kiro CLI's /usage report prints them. Plan names and the overage
## status (such as Enabled or Disabled) stay as the CLI prints them.

usage-kiro-credits-left = Credits left
# A window: bonus credits used, which expire on their own date.
usage-kiro-bonus-credits = Bonus credits
# A section's title and its fact: whether overages are enabled.
usage-kiro-overages = Overages
usage-kiro-overage-credits-used = Overage credits used
usage-kiro-estimated-overage-cost = Estimated overage cost
